  "title": "Kindergarten Addition and Subtraction Word Problems Within 10",
  "intro": "Extend familiar joining and taking-away stories to quantities within ten.",
  "html": "<h2>Teaching notes for parents and teachers</h2><h3>How to teach it</h3><p>Read the story aloud and let the student use counters, fingers, or a drawing. Connect the completed action to an equation afterward.</p><h3>Example to work through together</h3><p>Use the model below as you explain the example. Have your student point to the quantities as you discuss them.</p><div class=\"model tens-change-model kindergarten-ten-story-model\"><div class=\"tens-boxes\"><div class=\"tens-box\"><strong>Start with 6</strong><div class=\"counter-row red-counters\" aria-label=\"6 starting counters\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></div><p>Keep these counters on the mat.</p></div><div class=\"tens-box\"><strong>Bring 3 more</strong><div class=\"counter-row blue-counters\" aria-label=\"3 added counters\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></div><p>Slide these beside the first group.</p></div></div><p class=\"sample-equation\">6 + 3 = 9</p><p>Touch each counter once. There are nine counters altogether.</p></div><div class=\"model k-story-source-model\"><div class=\"art object-art\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"6 apples\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 145 80\" style=\"--art-width:145;--art-height:80\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><g transform=\"translate(18 10)\"><path d=\"M0 4Q-12 -4 -11 9Q-9 21 0 17Q9 21 11 9Q12 -4 0 4\" fill=\"#e67786\" stroke=\"#9f4e5f\"/><path d=\"M0 4Q0 -5 7 -4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#43816b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g transform=\"translate(45 10)\"><path d=\"M0 4Q-12 -4 -11 9Q-9 21 0 17Q9 21 11 9Q12 -4 0 4\" fill=\"#e67786\" stroke=\"#9f4e5f\"/><path d=\"M0 4Q0 -5 7 -4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#43816b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g transform=\"translate(72 10)\"><path d=\"M0 4Q-12 -4 -11 9Q-9 21 0 17Q9 21 11 9Q12 -4 0 4\" fill=\"#e67786\" stroke=\"#9f4e5f\"/><path d=\"M0 4Q0 -5 7 -4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#43816b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g transform=\"translate(99 10)\"><path d=\"M0 4Q-12 -4 -11 9Q-9 21 0 17Q9 21 11 9Q12 -4 0 4\" fill=\"#e67786\" stroke=\"#9f4e5f\"/><path d=\"M0 4Q0 -5 7 -4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#43816b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g transform=\"translate(126 10)\"><path d=\"M0 4Q-12 -4 -11 9Q-9 21 0 17Q9 21 11 9Q12 -4 0 4\" fill=\"#e67786\" stroke=\"#9f4e5f\"/><path d=\"M0 4Q0 -5 7 -4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#43816b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g transform=\"translate(18 40)\"><path d=\"M0 4Q-12 -4 -11 9Q-9 21 0 17Q9 21 11 9Q12 -4 0 4\" fill=\"#e67786\" stroke=\"#9f4e5f\"/><path d=\"M0 4Q0 -5 7 -4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#43816b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g></svg></div><div class=\"math-sign\">+</div><div class=\"art object-art\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"4 apples\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 145 50\" style=\"--art-width:145;--art-height:50\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><g transform=\"translate(18 10)\"><path d=\"M0 4Q-12 -4 -11 9Q-9 21 0 17Q9 21 11 9Q12 -4 0 4\" fill=\"#e67786\" stroke=\"#9f4e5f\"/><path d=\"M0 4Q0 -5 7 -4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#43816b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g transform=\"translate(45 10)\"><path d=\"M0 4Q-12 -4 -11 9Q-9 21 0 17Q9 21 11 9Q12 -4 0 4\" fill=\"#e67786\" stroke=\"#9f4e5f\"/><path d=\"M0 4Q0 -5 7 -4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#43816b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g transform=\"translate(72 10)\"><path d=\"M0 4Q-12 -4 -11 9Q-9 21 0 17Q9 21 11 9Q12 -4 0 4\" fill=\"#e67786\" stroke=\"#9f4e5f\"/><path d=\"M0 4Q0 -5 7 -4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#43816b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g transform=\"translate(99 10)\"><path d=\"M0 4Q-12 -4 -11 9Q-9 21 0 17Q9 21 11 9Q12 -4 0 4\" fill=\"#e67786\" stroke=\"#9f4e5f\"/><path d=\"M0 4Q0 -5 7 -4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#43816b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g></svg></div></div><div class=\"model k-story-source-model\"><div class=\"art object-art\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"7 apples, 7 crossed out\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 145 80\" style=\"--art-width:145;--art-height:80\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><g transform=\"translate(18 10)\"><path d=\"M0 4Q-12 -4 -11 9Q-9 21 0 17Q9 21 11 9Q12 -4 0 4\" fill=\"#e67786\" stroke=\"#9f4e5f\"/><path d=\"M0 4Q0 -5 7 -4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#43816b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M-13 -3L13 22M13 -3L-13 22\" stroke=\"#243d51\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g transform=\"translate(45 10)\"><path d=\"M0 4Q-12 -4 -11 9Q-9 21 0 17Q9 21 11 9Q12 -4 0 4\" fill=\"#e67786\" stroke=\"#9f4e5f\"/><path d=\"M0 4Q0 -5 7 -4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#43816b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M-13 -3L13 22M13 -3L-13 22\" stroke=\"#243d51\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g transform=\"translate(72 10)\"><path d=\"M0 4Q-12 -4 -11 9Q-9 21 0 17Q9 21 11 9Q12 -4 0 4\" fill=\"#e67786\" stroke=\"#9f4e5f\"/><path d=\"M0 4Q0 -5 7 -4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#43816b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M-13 -3L13 22M13 -3L-13 22\" stroke=\"#243d51\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g transform=\"translate(99 10)\"><path d=\"M0 4Q-12 -4 -11 9Q-9 21 0 17Q9 21 11 9Q12 -4 0 4\" fill=\"#e67786\" stroke=\"#9f4e5f\"/><path d=\"M0 4Q0 -5 7 -4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#43816b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M-13 -3L13 22M13 -3L-13 22\" stroke=\"#243d51\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g transform=\"translate(126 10)\"><path d=\"M0 4Q-12 -4 -11 9Q-9 21 0 17Q9 21 11 9Q12 -4 0 4\" fill=\"#e67786\" stroke=\"#9f4e5f\"/><path d=\"M0 4Q0 -5 7 -4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#43816b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M-13 -3L13 22M13 -3L-13 22\" stroke=\"#243d51\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g transform=\"translate(18 40)\"><path d=\"M0 4Q-12 -4 -11 9Q-9 21 0 17Q9 21 11 9Q12 -4 0 4\" fill=\"#e67786\" stroke=\"#9f4e5f\"/><path d=\"M0 4Q0 -5 7 -4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#43816b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M-13 -3L13 22M13 -3L-13 22\" stroke=\"#243d51\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g transform=\"translate(45 40)\"><path d=\"M0 4Q-12 -4 -11 9Q-9 21 0 17Q9 21 11 9Q12 -4 0 4\" fill=\"#e67786\" stroke=\"#9f4e5f\"/><path d=\"M0 4Q0 -5 7 -4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#43816b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M-13 -3L13 22M13 -3L-13 22\" stroke=\"#243d51\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g></svg></div></div><h3>Ask your student</h3><blockquote><p>Which objects are still here after the change?</p></blockquote><h3>If your student needs help</h3><p>If the student counts objects that were removed, place them clearly outside the working space.</p><h3>Choosing and using the worksheet</h3><p>This set contains four short, one-step stories with starting amounts, changes, and results from zero through ten. Some are still within five; the source retains those accessible cases. Choose the within-five page when tracking several counters is tiring. When this range is comfortable, ask the child to explain why their equation matches the action. Unknown starting amounts, comparison stories, and two-step problems are different structures and are not mixed into this set.</p>",
